[{"answer":"Good morning, North College Library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/1.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I was wondering if it was possible to join the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you a student at North College?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/4.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm not, but someone told me it was possible to join, even if I wasn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/5.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you over 18?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/7.mp3"},{"answer":"That's our minimum joining age.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/9.mp3"},{"answer":"That's no problem then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me what I have to do to join?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you'll need to come in to the library and fill out some forms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/12.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll also need to bring two passport photos with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/13.mp3"},{"answer":"We also need two documents for ID, so a driving licence would be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/15.mp3"},{"answer":"And what else? A credit card?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/16.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it needs to have your address on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall I bring a bank statement, would that do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/18.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Does it cost anything to join?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's free for students here but otherwise it's £125 per year","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/22.mp3"},{"answer":"or £25 if you've got a current student card from another college.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I was at Westerley College until last year but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/24.mp3"},{"answer":"now I've got a job at Jefferson's steel factory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, it's more expensive than I thought.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/26.mp3"},{"answer":"My local library is free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/27.mp3"},{"answer":"But you'll find they don't have the range of reference books or facilities which we buy for our students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/28.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why you have to pay to be an external member.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/30.mp3"},{"answer":"How many books can I borrow?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/31.mp3"},{"answer":"We allow twelve items borrowed at any one time if you're a student,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and that includes CDs, DVDs and videos.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/33.mp3"},{"answer":"However, it's only eight items for members of the public.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And how long can I have them for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you can have both fiction and reference books for four weeks","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/37.mp3"},{"answer":"which isn't bad really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/38.mp3"},{"answer":"And what happens if I return them late?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Like all libraries, there's a fine system in place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/40.mp3"},{"answer":"The minimum fine is £1.50","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but it can be much higher for some items - up to £5 per week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/42.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll give you a booklet with all the details when you join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/43.mp3"},{"answer":"You can always renew items if they're not required by anyone else","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/44.mp3"},{"answer":"by telephoning or logging on to our website.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/45.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the computers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I use them free of charge?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/47.mp3"},{"answer":"For college students it's free, but for external members like yourself,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/48.mp3"},{"answer":"the first hour is free","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and then we make a nominal charge of £1 per hour thereafter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Do I have to book in advance for them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes, it's advisable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people tend to book twenty-four hours in advance","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/53.mp3"},{"answer":"although sometimes you can get one with only six hours' notice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/54.mp3"},{"answer":"However, the earliest you can book a computer is forty-eight hours before you need it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can only book one hour at a time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/56.mp3"},{"answer":"If no-one else has booked the computer out,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/57.mp3"},{"answer":"then you may be able to have another hour if you want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/58.mp3"},{"answer":"We have a wide range of databases,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/59.mp3"},{"answer":"so the computers are in great demand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm thinking of doing some writing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/61.mp3"},{"answer":"and I might need to access national newspapers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have them on these databases?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/63.mp3"},{"answer":"We do indeed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/64.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got all the big nationals, The Guardian and The Observer, The Independent...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and The Times and Sunday Times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/66.mp3"},{"answer":"We've also got all the local papers","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and a wide selection of magazines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I assume you have photocopying facilities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/71.mp3"},{"answer":"5p a sheet for both A4 and A3 black-and-white copies","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/72.mp3"},{"answer":"and 40p a sheet for colour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/73.mp3"},{"answer":"You can get a card from the counter here - it doesn't take coins.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh by the way, another thing I was wondering about was","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/76.mp3"},{"answer":"if you ran any writing classes through the library?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/77.mp3"},{"answer":"We do, but you'll have to speak to John Grantingham about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/78.mp3"},{"answer":"He's our resident author.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/79.mp3"},{"answer":"He runs the creative writing classes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/80.mp3"},{"answer":"John... Grant.... Could you spell that for me please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/82.mp3"},{"answer":"GRANTINGHAM.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Are the classes here at the library?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes - he's here on Thursday evenings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/85.mp3"},{"answer":"No, sorry, Friday - he's just changed it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/86.mp3"},{"answer":"You can contact him by emailing the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well that's about all I need to know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/90.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be along later this week to join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks. Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-1-2023-08-05-19-32-05/92.mp3"}]
